      "latex": "\\sigma^{2}(A_{M})=\\sigma^{2}(\\alpha_{M i})+\\sigma^{2}(\\alpha_{M j})=2\\sum p_{i}\\alpha_{M i}^{2}=2\\sigma^{2}(\\alpha_{M})",
