      "latex": "\\sigma^{2}(D_{M})=\\sum p_{i j}\\delta_{M i j}^{2}=\\sigma^{2}(\\delta_{M})",
      "latex_render": "\\sigma^{2}(D_{M})=\\sum p_{i j}\\delta_{M i j}^{2}=\\sigma^{2}(\\delta_{M})",
